  "news": "<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🇨🇳 大中华视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.economist.com/china/2026/10/01/china-lavishes-attention-on-a-little-known-competition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">中国大力投入鲜为人知的体育赛事</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">China lavishes attention on a little-known competition</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">中国正投入大量资源和关注于一项此前鲜为人知的体育赛事，此举可能旨在提升国家软实力和国际影响力，值得关注其长期效果和战略意图。（中立）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">经济学人</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.scmp.com/news/world/united-states-canada/article/3369639/trump-expected-name-jay-clayton-ai-tsar?utm_source=rss_feed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">特朗普有望任命杰伊·克莱顿为人工智能沙皇</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Trump expected to name Jay Clayton as AI tsar</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">据报道，美国前总统特朗普预计将任命前证券交易委员会主席杰伊·克莱顿为人工智能事务负责人，此举预示着未来美国政府在AI政策制定上可能采取的新方向。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">南华早报(独立港媒)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.taipeitimes.com/News/front/archives/2026/10/03/2003865308\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">台湾接收首批两架F-16V Block 70战斗机</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Taiwan receives first 2 F-16V Block 70s</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">台湾已接收首批两架F-16V Block 70型战斗机，这批先进战机将显著提升台湾的空防能力，对地区军事平衡和台海局势具有重要影响。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">台北时报(台湾)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cwy7zrljp527o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">军情五处警告：中国资助英国研究并将其情报送至北京间谍机构</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">China funding UK research and sending it to Beijing&#x27;s spies, MI5 warns</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">英国军情五处（MI5）发出警告，指责中国资助英国学术研究并利用这些成果为北京的间谍活动服务，引发对国家安全和知识产权保护的担忧。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC中国报道</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🇺🇸 北美视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.npr.org/2026/10/02/nx-s1-5985789/trump-arch-protest-veterans-midterms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">特朗普提议的拱门方案笼罩华盛顿特区，抗议者将希望寄托于中期选举</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">As Trump&#x27;s proposed arch looms over D.C., protesters pin their hopes on the midterms</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">随着特朗普提议在华盛顿特区建造的拱门项目引发争议，反对者将希望寄托于即将到来的中期选举，以期通过政治变革阻止该项目并表达不满。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">NPR(公共广播,中偏左)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.theatlantic.com/newsletters/2026/10/maga-sarah-huckabee-sanders-woke/688876/?utm_source=feed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">右翼身份政治出现诡异转变</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">The Right’s Identity Politics Takes a Bizarre Turn</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">右翼的身份政治论述正呈现出某种不同寻常的转变，这种演变可能反映出社会思潮的变化或政治策略的调整，值得关注其对政治格局的影响。（批评性报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">The Atlantic(中偏左)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://foreignpolicy.com/2026/10/02/g7-release-emergency-diesel-crude-stockpiles-fuel-prices-trump/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">七国集团同意释放1亿桶战略柴油储备</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">G-7 Agrees to Release 100 Million Barrels of Reserve Diesel</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">七国集团（G7）已达成协议，决定释放1亿桶战略柴油储备，此举旨在稳定全球能源市场，应对供应紧张和价格上涨的压力。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">外交政策(外交专业)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.axios.com/2026/10/02/judge-blocks-big-bend-border-wall-texas\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">法官阻止大弯国家公园边境墙建设</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Big Bend border wall construction blocked by judge</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">一名法官阻止了在大弯国家公园区域修建边境墙的计划，这一裁决对环保主义者是重大胜利，也再次引发关于边境安全与环境保护之间平衡的辩论。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">Axios(简报风)</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🌍 欧洲视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://english.elpais.com/international/2026-10-02/the-truth-is-cuba-has-already-fallen-the-united-states-strategy-to-subdue-the-island.html\" target=\"_blank\